SUMMARY:Create AI Agents Championship 2026-27 (Dubai)
LOCATION:Dubai\, UAE (entry by submission)
DESCRIPTION:Dubai's global competition to turn AI agents into real products
 \, in four categories. A Digital Academy launches in November\; entrants s
 ubmit a prototype\, pitch deck and demo video by December 2026.\nEligibili
 ty: Open to individuals and teams worldwide with no minimum age. The Youth
  category is for under-21s\, so a 21-24 student would enter another catego
 ry.\nDates are approximate.\nRegistration closes in December 2026 (exact d
 ay not published). Digital Academy launches in November. Official Create A
 pps site still shows the previous edition.\nSource: https://fastcompanyme.
 com/news/dubai-launches-global-push-to-turn-ai-agents-into-real-world-prod
 ucts/
URL:https://fastcompanyme.com/news/dubai-launches-global-push-to-turn-ai-ag
 ents-into-real-world-products/
CATEGORIES:Competition
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
