SUMMARY:NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026
LOCATION:Local events or virtual universal event
DESCRIPTION:NASA's two-day global hackathon on open space-agency data. The 
 2026 theme is The Next Frontier\, with 14 challenges. Join a local event o
 r the virtual universal event\; teams of up to six. Submissions close 15 N
 ovember.\nEligibility: All ages\, skill levels and professional background
 s welcome. Create a Space Apps account\, register\, and pick a local or vi
 rtual event\; up to six per team.\nRegistration stays open until the hacka
 thon closes on 15 November\; project submissions open 14 Nov 9:00 AM and c
 lose 15 Nov 11:59 PM local time. The team step opens 17 Sep. The local-eve
 nts page showed no listings when fetched\, so no Oman…\nApply: https://w
 ww.spaceappschallenge.org/2026/
URL:https://www.spaceappschallenge.org/2026/
